{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年29歲的TVB力捧花旦劉穎鏇（Tiffany），是2016年港姐亞軍兼最上鏡小姐，憑藉甜美可人的樣貌、176cm 的高挑身材以及親切貼地的性格，迅速俘虜大批觀眾的心，觀眾緣極佳。入行10年，劉穎鏇一直「肯博肯捱」，在多部劇集如《超能使者》、《隱形戰隊》、《奪命提示》均有亮眼演出，更於《萬千星輝頒獎典禮2023》中，以大熱之勢奪得「飛躍進步女藝員」被網民公認為TVB的「最強Body」。</p><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇有「最強body」稱號。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251015/1055120793941577728762835.jpeg/Xzj22eIdUidEcRZfW6MV-UecRXPpIAn8mTmZ55k5mec\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇有「最強body」稱號。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樣子甜美。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251015/1055120791466807296328567.jpeg/5xgFeKtPvmbP3RDkGgvveALdCBnOQv6Z__BWNv_wVjY\"/><figcaption>樣子甜美。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成為新一代打女。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251015/1055120788866207744743896.jpeg/BzyVpn9UukXKlTXVwlWYpQ7kaakoHHtOjHOW64xzlus\"/><figcaption>成為新一代打女。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇熱愛打籃球。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251015/1055121020496646144176390.jpeg/zcw80VpS0YT6WgA74sg2A7XzZhURu2_AQfwdd0H8HXc\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇熱愛打籃球。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>緊身背心難掩豐滿身材 網民大讚「幾有料」</p><p>近日，劉穎鏇在個人社交平台分享了一組最新靚相，並配上英文勵志金句：「i read a quote the other day… “you don’t have to be great to start, but you have to start to be great” 🫶🏻and i couldn’t agree more! instead of fearing failure, we should be fearing regret!! hope this can be a lil reminder for all of us to do that thing that we’ve always wanted to do（我前幾天看到一段話……『你不需要很厲害才開始，但你需要開始才會變得厲害』，我非常認同！我們不應該害怕失敗，而是應該害怕遺憾！希望這能成為大家的一個小提醒，去完成那些我們一直想做的事。）」激勵自己與粉絲。</p><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇在個人社交平台分享了一組最新靚相。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185984819067097088394870.jpeg/bmHPINWy7s-bSZxjNmsCMm_l8FynKLerMZOapjGTmqY\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇在個人社交平台分享了一組最新靚相。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇自我激勵。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185985051750305792504897.png/QuhE6I0udhy2Rhii8MvMS9Z7LTbMRjy6hl9f_4ZfX_8\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇自我激勵。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><p>相片中的劉穎鏇，雖然身穿淺藍色長袖襯衫，看似包得頗為密實，但內搭的一件白色貼身背心短Tee，卻完全遮擋不住其極具立體感的豐滿上圍；下身則搭配黑色超短熱褲，修長美腿若隱若現，非常有吸引力。不少網民紛紛留言大讚：「好靚女」、「beautiful angel」、「幾有料」、「Perfect」。</p><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇身材無得輸。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185985248454774784412387.jpeg/NJ_amB7Ub0k08IH7R8G_CM7iMRwd519hSTMBT0kzAU8\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇身材無得輸。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"顏值爆燈。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185985446350426112784321.jpeg/qU9d7se479-1RKeXujYF8zl3Jc0u1JRdwRXJaMEVyWg\"/><figcaption>顏值爆燈。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><p>劇集存貨清空 未有坐以待斃創自家品牌</p><p>不過，亦有心水清的網民留意到，劉穎鏇近段時間在電視上的曝光率似乎有所減少，未有新劇推出的消息。翻查資料，劉穎鏇自劇集《飛常日誌II》拍畢後，手頭上的劇集存貨已基本播放完畢，雖然稍後有主持工作，但暫時未有新劇拍檔或播出的排期，令不少粉絲相當焦急，留言問道：「有沒有新劇呀，好想看」；而面對拍劇的「被動」狀態，劉穎鏇未有坐以待斃，早在今年初開始個人服裝品牌，更親自擔任「生招牌」，為自己未來的事業發展多開闢一條出路，非常識諗。</p><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇為自己品牌擔任模特兒。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185985948979040256521894.jpeg/NvpM-h8W16SnKQ7vIPAkmT7EjZXGL5HL-ahtbvmobW4\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇為自己品牌擔任模特兒。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇在TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝頒獎典禮2023》中，以大熱之勢奪得「飛躍進步女藝員」（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240807/897920384253300736529641.jpeg/JGqQpKYviD2wY2gbeRScttzo6Diw-I3pg8BuoIPAbqA\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇在TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝頒獎典禮2023》中，以大熱之勢奪得「飛躍進步女藝員」（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇在劇集《超能使者》其中一幕性感大解放。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221121/671309480050298880359748.png/2Z4h21NhXbN2O8iN78UDsuNeZlPRGZD8n5wXB5-cFwc\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇在劇集《超能使者》其中一幕性感大解放。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇在《奪命提示》打戲都好精彩。（《奪命提示》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250320/979455533432049664039562.jpeg/oDS60QoMWaqIi4Tbxe3xtTwhGt1Gzj-9yVSfA8lUnwM\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇在《奪命提示》打戲都好精彩。（《奪命提示》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陽光。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240109/821469367488221184460598.jpeg/-7WbPBf7xx55Izf04ylMu2g1CIu_aSuT-lyILPpciCw\"/><figcaption>陽光。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陽光。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240109/821469370193678336735218.jpeg/XAm9QV-xOop3wjqOtluFYIRi7B_hRUsizplpK86ZaSs\"/><figcaption>陽光。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新一代打女。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240109/821469372987215872716025.jpeg/XJsv10QVrfOsZ3bvg15VgHXpFRG-XCGFSdhd_UnYXf0\"/><figcaption>新一代打女。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷長腿。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240109/821469375042555904307142.jpeg/hM7cQufRW9sauRmAmXTlgQLIhHyzVxZMc3wwd3N8MHc\"/><figcaption>大騷長腿。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"備受力捧。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240109/821469377257279488970543.jpeg/_WMltDx5T8BVHkMkZO6TSwH8xKdNO8Hs0CA8UNAgPFA\"/><figcaption>備受力捧。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tiffany好靚呀。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210606/478155844119171072621985.jpeg/9a52FJUzHuPXbklFqu1VbekxYoeJSNDMhuUtx4blLcc\"/><figcaption>Tiffany好靚呀。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（Tiffany）真係勁Fit。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200814/370976832704614400.jpeg/TFC6p_jM6szULFEBcZmXykzt8yjFplib8MtVfvDLVX4\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（Tiffany）真係勁Fit。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"畢業啦。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220109/556890276598124544136890.jpeg/lkh0AT-0LzsfO7t1WN6L8Vd_nDF6mDJHzq_j4c6v4-E\"/><figcaption>畢業啦。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青春。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220109/556890279316164608041796.jpeg/ly6oNq3pmL1udH0FDVq35hyY0F3NxTvu3_aGit_2hoo\"/><figcaption>青春。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青春。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220109/556890281954512896674320.jpeg/DaXXptspIuC2ukXAtpQElaeNRyEsP_VBfQqNdH0KjXQ\"/><figcaption>青春。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好開心。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220109/556890284727078912594103.jpeg/4Qfzuafr-mhR1KZGDiACe0RnWQsMXgbAx_ICLsfyAi4\"/><figcaption>好開心。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"短頭髮。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210109/424529487733067776435921.jpeg/QHlm8DhOxAzzXZ4ZFYt-Nn4WKkzl4X4ft3Y2Obd2Njk\"/><figcaption>短頭髮。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"短頭髮。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210109/424529490123952128108546.jpeg/hpdr-_M4hl8Rpff6caE9TheNGYj3TEDkRQAr6kUAK-o\"/><figcaption>短頭髮。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（Tiffany）真係勁Fit。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200629/354404670434840576.jpeg/Esv7MYDGzEC0I85BbXpva9mPOUw75VdLh-z4dIfs-HQ\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（Tiffany）真係勁Fit。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201002/388793420493230080.jpeg/vJwWdKXBCOjx4WDhzQT30y_5nc_6k1qH5GJkguRiZII\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"短頭髮。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210109/424529492397395968071268.jpeg/O689-PUkmDq8jsDe4q9ZuyOgyxcobmXyXYYIrF2GCKw\"/><figcaption>短頭髮。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇在外景期間已非常突出。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340579406961577984.jpeg/CsBSeMRInNAKG4h519spbCJrxgYBFBN-86DKQfOgykE\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇在外景期間已非常突出。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇《3日2夜》充滿陽光氣息。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575647774674944.jpeg/W9uXIBlQtMvoOgXLRR3x1T81Mb4jhlJMnb3WcJ291nA\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇《3日2夜》充滿陽光氣息。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340577947918405632.jpeg/UTTyXvIFG3cwuh7V-s2UXURCEU14QHn2ObNnXDmzZ1w\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575652400992256.jpeg/2eHsLwTUGL1H9PqvS4HZUZEG8kjffX-GJmDCCyZgwgs\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340577941610172416.jpeg/Lu0dHCNgsIfrQZM47Jg_dSvcAqe0_1y5ZRhvh2UYb4c\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340577944781066240.jpeg/-7xRJn3JmqN1NwliRkD1s1XReykxPMN_1QyPbdUMj20\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇在《兄弟》有演出。（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340577958953619456.jpeg/sJxlGQrAXtUYFbbccRuI5v0_8G1Pl3AbGWpshRlqbIU\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇在《兄弟》有演出。（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575654531698688.jpeg/Z79i_PLdrGE2gBnvAvFigbBdiM_lRosuapkZeGqZGXg\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575658310766592.jpeg/1bwaPZNBBdBujscEOQvN2UaCn0DhouDg8__CI_P_wiM\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575659850076160.jpeg/nRTyVxsTDlLHngOigSAT3SHwI3hUE4MR3e7jRt3u40Y\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575490542800896.jpeg/YlR0ScpxUbEMmYOzwJ4akKlPQGvg-nqNf-qID3_qiA8\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575492400877568.jpeg/cUFwZGWzmIKk6liTL0YR1zKf20T6faHeefQoEHn0KBA\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575498323234816.jpeg/PlqEGo7Vnw8ZjWqLtrpSopkeRtQdfDzzOgE_bzoBP28\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575502240714752.jpeg/OASf4PyuTqCPlPFir4kf9KhW-cLafI8MNvqA3zb6gN8\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575485836791808.jpeg/eUJm8KvRd73SvTGEGvHTYX985fJi16puRQFiBEUBYgQ\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340575487686479872.jpeg/JiBRPJa7jIopoFn-9ed5XAmOT_9fN2hrQnaP_EJ2j_w\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340579405237719041.jpeg/sn-2k_hDNynntZYVUtrrvN97BjyAo_neLwlz9C8Jc_Q\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200522/340579408513470464.jpeg/1W_XJs0vLIL6e8N6m6xzKbv9s04uFzmwXmzI0V5syNE\"/><figcaption>劉穎鏇（IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感尤物。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240102/818914079723753472829634.jpeg/wu-rad0sVr0XPOdwY-KCzt1kYwE691Up-xy2Hvscth4\"/><figcaption>性感尤物。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感尤物。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240102/818914082039140352952370.jpeg/rgZopWW8Adb8DRHQvYd5xBx0GkCMIvDzkND5VpDQ-VY\"/><figcaption>性感尤物。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感尤物。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240102/818914084245475328598274.jpeg/86rVLkyqAPVJrwZxv3xqwqPGh7jR6aVUptAyYKbQMmA\"/><figcaption>性感尤物。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好長腿。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240102/818914086808326144583712.jpeg/YQKWz__Qu6zW0tqaOOyzSymBd4SdAMrb92EZVvdhGVY\"/><figcaption>好長腿。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240102/818914089270513664683971.jpeg/_Q9XOSs3turRXXt7-tDLwdQpr114vZqmbo1zRm6Nc0Y\"/><figure><img alt=\"好長腿。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240102/818914091619454976514637.jpeg/fsKP1nyGUG4NQkzblyZL6org_c9u-uXrogc-6KIHPug\"/><figcaption>好長腿。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T00:18:23.160528+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2239,"images":52,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}